                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 90.13,
                  "content": "A Heerich instance holds a 3D grid of voxels and knows how to project them into 2D SVG. You initialize one by providing grid dimensions, a rendering tile size in pixels, and an optional baseline style applied universally across the active sequence.",
