                          "name": "This dramatically simplifies creating sy",
                          "context": "p",
                          "fill": "#fbf4ea",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 307.63,
                          "height": 135.19,
                          "content": "This dramatically simplifies creating symmetrical structures: construct one facet, then repeatedly rotate clones around a central pivot. (For example, the Kreuzplastik in the gallery below derives entirely from a single arm sequence rotated into a cross.)",
