                          "width": 307.63,
                          "height": 135.19,
                          "content": "All path commands are supported, both absolute (M, L, H, V, C, S, Q, T, A, Z) and relative (m, l, h, v, c, s, q, t, a, z) — arcs are automatically converted to cubic beziers before warping. Only <path> elements are supported for now; other shapes must be converted to paths first.",
