                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "sYZXH",
                          "name": "Every single voxel supports an internal ",
                          "context": "p",
                          "fill": "#fbf4ea",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 307.63,
                          "height": 135.19,
                          "content": "Every single voxel supports an internal scale — an [x, y, z] envelope mapped from 0 to 1 that collapses the volume along internal axes. Scaled geometry automatically triggers non-opaque rendering, correctly preserving visibility for occluded geometry layered behind it.",
