                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 307.63,
                          "height": 112.66,
                          "content": "Ensuring opaque: false explicitly directs neighboring elements to render their intersection faces accurately. Otherwise, neighbors would falsely assume a solid structure is blocking their boundaries.",
