                          "name": "findVoxels(predicate) scans the entire v",
                          "context": "p",
                          "fill": "#fbf4ea",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 307.63,
                          "height": 112.66,
                          "content": "findVoxels(predicate) scans the entire voxel map and returns every voxel for which the predicate returns true. The most common pattern is tagging groups at add time with a meta id, then querying by that id later.",
